<title>HUNGARY: Hungary BUX ends at 5,840.65 pts, up 37.39.</title>
<headline>Hungary BUX ends at 5,840.65 pts, up 37.39.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The BUX index of the Budapest Stock Exchange (BSE) finished at 5,840.65 points, up 37.39, official BSE figures showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover was 3.11 billion forints, up from Tuesday's 2.73 billion.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
